        {
            "block_label": "figure_title",
            "block_content": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\">Table 1: Failure taxonomy for LLM-assisted economic theory development. F1–F5 are concrete enough to be adjudicated against a finished manuscript and are scored in Section 5; F5 is coded by checking bibliography usability and whether cited sources support the claims assigned to them.</div>\n",
            "block_bbox": [
